      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ker pa Rekoboam doŋ omoko maber, kun medde ki cuŋ matek, en kacel ki jo Icrael ducu gucako bwoto cik pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me loc pa Rekoboam me abicce, en aye Cicak kabaka me Ejipt obino kwede ka lweny i kom jo Jerucalem, pien gubwoto Rwot woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gubino ki gadigadi lweny alip acel ki miya aryo, ki lulweny ma giriŋo ki aguragura alip pyerabicel. Lwakjo ma welgi pe kwanne gubino kwede ma gua ki i Ejipt, jo Libya, jo Cukiim, ki jo Etiopia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci omako gaŋi ma girumo ki cel gogo ma i Juda ducu nio kwede wa i Jerucalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cemaya ma lanebi ocito bot Rekoboam ki bot rwodi me Juda, ma onoŋo gucokke i Jerucalem pi Cicak owaco botgi ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Wun wuryeko bwoto an woko, pi meno an bene atyeko miyowu i ciŋ Cicak.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwodi me Icrael kacel ki kabaka gumwolle woko, omiyo guwacci, “Rwot lokke tye kakare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Rwot oneno ni gumwolle kengi, lok pa Rwot obino bot Cemaya ma wacci, “Gin gumwolle kengi; pe doŋ abityekogi woko, ento doŋ abilarogi, pe doŋ abitoyo akemona i kom Jerucalem ki cin Cicak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento gibibedo luticce, ka wek guŋe tic kweda ki dok me tic ki luloc me lobo mukene bene,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
